    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS are delighted to present this wonderful studio apartment to the Dublin rental market.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned just off the historic Mountjoy Square, Flat 8 at 32 Charles Street Great offers a fantastic opportunity to live in a vibrant city-centre location while enjoying the comfort of a well-proportioned and modern residence.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a bright and well-proportioned living and sleeping area leading into a contemporary kitchen area, fully equipped with integrated appliances, sleek cabinetry and a charming dining nook, perfect for city living.\r\n\r\nThe property is completed with a modern bathroom equipped with an electric shower, providing comfortable and practical accommodation in this highly central location.\r\n\r\nThe location is a particular highlight. Situated in a prime Dublin 1 location, the apartment is within walking distance of O’Connell Street, the IFSC and the Mater Hospital. The beautiful green spaces of Mountjoy Square are right on the doorstep, providing a tranquil escape from the urban hustle.\r\n\r\nWith every conceivable amenity nearby, including restaurants, cafés and excellent public transport links via the LUAS, DART and extensive bus networks, this property truly offers the best of Dublin city living.\r\n\r\nA standout feature of this tenancy is the inclusion of both building Wi-Fi and refuse collection in the monthly rent at no additional cost. This provides residents with added peace of mind and simplifies monthly budgeting in this highly central location.\r\n\r\nWith its bright and well-proportioned living and sleeping area, contemporary kitchen, modern bathroom and outstanding Dublin 1 location, Flat 8 at 32 Charles Street Great offers an excellent opportunity to secure a comfortable and well-connected studio home in the heart of Dublin.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment with MoveHome Estate Agents."
      },
